    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the insurance law, the public health law and the financial services law, in relation to establishing protections to prevent surprise medical bills including network adequacy requirements, claim submission requirements, adequacy of and access to out-of-network care and prohibition of excessive emergency charges; and providing for the repeal of certain provisions upon expiration thereof",
